              Clogged drains, leaking pipes, water heater failures, toilet problems — fixed same-day. Flat-rate pricing with a $79 service call credited toward your repair.
            </p>

            <!-- Trust pills -->
            <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-bottom:32px">
